# Regenerable API/response cache — ~599 MB as of 2026-09-07 (2,798 files: 1,325 daily-return
# series, 1,323 decompositions, 127 holdings vintages, 5 portfolio series, plus stage/result
# JSON). Rebuilt by build_lagged.py / deshaw_fetch.py / deshaw_fetch_history.py.
#
# Regenerable but NOT free: the D. E. Shaw history extension alone cost ~$46 (767 names).
# Check what is already cached before re-fetching.
cache/

# Byte-compiled files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Derived/binary output — regenerable, and this is a public repo (PR #373 review).
# charts/: every PNG is rebuilt by the chart_*.py scripts.
# attribution_audit.xlsx: rebuilt by `python build_audit_xlsx.py`, verified by verify_audit_xlsx.py.
charts/
*.png
*.xlsx
*.pdf

# Vendor factor-constituent map — an internal data artifact, not ours to redistribute.
